    StartMainStorageTask
                    Start specified "action" on the main storage NAS
                    Action "repair" and "reset" are done on current applied configuration (other fields may have random value)
                    Action "test_access", "test_config" and "initial_setup" are done using parameters of the current command


                 Arguments
                    sessionId (com:SessionIdentifier)
                    action (str:ActionType)
                    ipAddress (com:IpAddress)
                    protocol (str:Protocol)
                    port (xsd:int)
                    password (xsd:string)


                 Response


